---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro"
---

<Base title="找不到这一页 · NBTCA">
  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="panel reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Not found</p>
      <h1>找不到这一页</h1>
      <p class="muted">链接可能输错了，或者这张卡片、这场活动已经不在了。</p>
      <div class="row">
        <a class="button" href="/">回到首页</a>
        <a class="button ghost" href="/e">去看看活动</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  main {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    min-height: 60svh;
  }

  section {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    max-width: 30rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
